                    "body": "Based on how difficult it is to explain (see other thread), I think it makes more sense to show new users the easiest method by default, and if they want the more \"idiomatic\" / performant (slightly) option we can show it as an alternative.  The FAQ is going to be read by people who may not want to create directories, new files, and update their fpath.",
